# An owner that refuses an edit, or doesn't answer it, leaves its file as it was and the status
# line says why (docs/extensions.md, "Owners and types, as built"). tests/drive.rs installs a
# csv-table whose file/edit refuses everything, and doesn't answer at all for a VEI of 9:
# cold-lava gives up after 10 s, and the menu goes on meanwhile.
size 140x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace
keys /
type krakatoa
wait-for Krakatoa
keys enter
wait-for ← Eruptions.csv  | Krakatoa | 1883 | 6 |
keys left A
wait-for Read the Royal Society report on Krakatoa
keys G x
wait-for 12s not ticked: csv-table didn't edit Volcanoes/Eruptions.csv: this copy is read-only
expect ☐ Read the Royal Society report on Krakatoa
keys esc
wait-for cold-lava workspaces
keys i
wait-for eruption        8
type erup
wait-for rows · /erup
keys enter
wait-for 8 rows
keys /
type krakatoa
keys enter
wait-for 2 of 8 rows · /krakatoa
keys j e ctrl+u
type 9
keys enter
# While csv-table says nothing, another edit of the file is refused at once.
keys e ctrl+u
type 8
keys enter
wait-for not saved, Volcanoes/Eruptions.csv has an edit waiting for csv-table: try again
keys k
wait-for 15s not saved: csv-table didn't edit Volcanoes/Eruptions.csv: it didn't answer file/edit in 10 s
expect   6   ·
screen
keys q q
exits 0
